1
00:00:00,513 --> 00:00:03,303
(Penny:)- Sheldon.
- Ugh. Sorry.

2
00:00:06,018 --> 00:00:10,228
Boy, we gotta get you into a better office.
Something more suited to your status.

3
00:00:10,398 --> 00:00:13,648
- You don't have to go to trouble.
- How about von Gerlach's old office?

4
00:00:13,818 --> 00:00:16,908
- I'd rather have Fishbein's. It's bigger.
GABLEHAUSER: Done.

5
00:00:17,071 --> 00:00:19,071
Wait, I called dibs on Fishbein's office...

6
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:22,660
(Howard:)...the day he started showing up at work
in his bathrobe.

7
00:00:22,827 --> 00:00:25,827
He gets a new office, I can't get
paper towels in the men's room?

8
00:00:25,997 --> 00:00:28,707
(Penny:)- Sheldon.
- Damn, this is hard.

9
00:00:35,548 --> 00:00:38,588
Let me ask you, what do you think
the business of this place is?

10
00:00:41,053 --> 00:00:43,263
[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

11
00:00:45,057 --> 00:00:46,137
- Science?
- Money.

12
00:00:46,309 --> 00:00:47,889
(Howard:)Told you.

13
00:00:48,394 --> 00:00:50,894
(Gablehauser:)And this boy's picture
in People magazine...

14
00:00:51,063 --> 00:00:53,603
...is gonna raise us
a pile of money taller than...

15
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,110
(Gablehauser:)Well, taller than you.

16
00:00:57,904 --> 00:01:02,024
- I have a master's degree.
- Who doesn't?

